{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-js","path":"/boom_boom_mummy_mummy","webpackCompilationHash":"8cc9788010e3663b7336","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>This loom design is a stylized version of the drawings from <a href=\"http://www.zombie-and-mummy.org\">http://www.zombie-and-mummy.org</a> </p>\n<p>pattern:</p>\n<img src=\"/mummy-57a221120c2ceb455bc393b2b72bac11.gif\" width=\"300\"/> \n<p>off the loom: </p>\n<p><a href=\"/boom_boom_mummy_mummy_sm1-388c28be94e07e37c9d370b55968006e.jpg\"><img src=\"/boom_boom_mummy_mummy_sm1-388c28be94e07e37c9d370b55968006e.jpg\" title=\"boom_boom_mummy_mummy_sm1\"></a> </p>\n<p>framed: </p>\n<p><a href=\"/boom_boom_mummy_mummy_frame-e988594619f02dd560f1821d9c8cf73c.jpg\"><img src=\"/boom_boom_mummy_mummy_frame-e988594619f02dd560f1821d9c8cf73c.jpg\" title=\"boom_boom_mummy_mummy_frame\"></a>          </p>","frontmatter":{"path":"/boom_boom_mummy_mummy","title":"Boom Boom Mummy Mummy","date":"2003-11-28","tags":["beadwork"]}}},"pageContext":{"isCreatedByStatefulCreatePages":false,"prev":{"html":"<p>A bottle of Yoohoo drink covered in size 11 seed beads. I specially ordered copper colored beads for this one! I think it's the best thing I've made. </p>\n<p>the plan: </p>\n<p><a href=\"/blank-8bb9396e1cf012e9141ef460afe968ad.gif\"><img src=\"/blank-8bb9396e1cf012e9141ef460afe968ad.gif\" title=\"blank\"></a> <a href=\"/blucka_ani-0c1714e038d981339a30ee88660f3b50.gif\"><img src=\"/blucka_ani-0c1714e038d981339a30ee88660f3b50.gif\" title=\"blucka_ani\"></a> </p>\n<p>all finished: </p>\n<p><a href=\"/finished_1-4b0b57116cf6108751bb12cb7e06dfdb.jpg\"><img src=\"/finished_1-4b0b57116cf6108751bb12cb7e06dfdb.jpg\" title=\"finished_1\"></a> <a href=\"/finished_2-0ff1a662f82ccc66556d954a82be0db3.jpg\"><img src=\"/finished_2-0ff1a662f82ccc66556d954a82be0db3.jpg\" title=\"finished_2\"></a> <a href=\"/finished_3-f7b4712db43bf901723ef72ad791df95.jpg\"><img src=\"/finished_3-f7b4712db43bf901723ef72ad791df95.jpg\" title=\"finished_3\"></a> </p>","id":"13db9660-ff11-5f1f-aa10-4884a5fb18c9","frontmatter":{"path":"/blucka_bluck","title":"Blucka Bluck","date":"2003-11-28","tags":["6502","beadwork","cna"],"hexagonImages":["blank.gif_hexagon.png","blucka_ani.gif_hexagon.png","finished_1.jpg_hexagon.jpeg","finished_2.jpg_hexagon.jpeg","finished_3.jpg_hexagon.jpeg"]}},"next":{"html":"<p>The fire stand is designed as a display stand for my beaded bottles - blucka bluck, cna yoohoo, etc. The idea was to make a display that made it appear that the bottle was lit by campfire. A platform holding the bottle rotates, showing the bottle from all sides and also moving powered contacts around under a circle of LEDs which flicker with many colors. </p>\n<p><a href=\"/bottom-388b2e198d7383ef29400ae241c196a7.jpg\"><img src=\"/bottom-388b2e198d7383ef29400ae241c196a7.jpg\" title=\"bottom\"></a> </p>\n<p><a href=\"/side-d40c9afc82bda0e214f54a7ad6bf8524.jpg\"><img src=\"/side-d40c9afc82bda0e214f54a7ad6bf8524.jpg\" title=\"side\"></a> </p>\n<p><a href=\"/firestand-c9a9f54ae89e6d4dccacc01ad90fb55d.jpg\"><img src=\"/firestand-c9a9f54ae89e6d4dccacc01ad90fb55d.jpg\" title=\"firestand\"></a> </p>","id":"f7fb0c24-8ed4-5d95-a8f6-7e631a1ff8c3","frontmatter":{"path":"/fire_stand","title":"Fire Stand","date":"2003-11-28","tags":["artwork","beadwork","cna","electronics"],"hexagonImages":["bottom.jpg_hexagon.jpeg","side.jpg_hexagon.jpeg","firestand.jpg_hexagon.jpeg"]}}}}}